# head/adult/man/wince_elf: an elf's wince (man): restrained, the lips pressed to one pixel under the squeezed eyes
# P2b FACES (wave 2), over the generic hurt face (expr, z 2). Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
use person
body man
role head fine
role head sharp
role head longelf
layer face
anchor head
keys expr
z 3
tags overlay mirror-ok

view D key hurt origin -7 -12
|s

view R key hurt origin -12 -12
|s

view L key hurt origin -3 -12
|t
